# Lane H.4 — trivy allowlist for the distroless image.
#
# Policy:
#   - Default scan command is:
#       trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --exit-code 1 \
#         ghcr.io/sasuketorii/rev-stealth:${VERSION}
#   - This file lists CVEs intentionally accepted (must include expiry +
#     justification). Empty by default; entries are reviewed quarterly.
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line; comments allowed.

# (no exceptions as of v1.3.0 plumbing)
